error[E4103]: cannot move out of `a` because it is borrowed
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4103_move_while_borrowed.tarn:30:10
   |
29 |     r := &a
   |          -- shared borrow of `a` starts here
30 |     b := a
   |          ^ moved here while borrowed
31 |     read(r)
